invariant: INV-4
file: drbg.c
catches: drbg_test
reason: ch_drbg_seed refuses a seed of exactly CH_DRBG_SEED_MIN bytes,
  the one-key seed drbg.h admits, so an image that seeds from one 32-byte
  buffer faults at boot. bin/drbg_test passes exactly 32 bytes and
  requires CH_ASSERT to stay quiet.

--- old
    CH_ASSERT(seed_len >= CH_DRBG_SEED_MIN); // a short seed is a programmer error (drbg.h)
--- new
    CH_ASSERT(seed_len > CH_DRBG_SEED_MIN); // a short seed is a programmer error (drbg.h)
